  "extension_rule": "The exact-SHA-qualified canonical state model remains unchanged. This engine adds a versioned parent-owned lifecycle ledger for unit state, transition receipts, idempotency and invalidation. The ledger references an exact canonical parent state version/digest and does not redefine the base model's qualified claims.",
